\par
\b Camera drivers (optional feature, on by default)\b0\par
The "Camera drivers" feature installs two third-party driver packages exactly as their makers ship them:\par
- Basler pylon USB Camera Driver (Basler AG)\par
- IC4 GenTL Driver for USB3Vision Devices (The Imaging Source Europe GmbH)\par
They are separate products under their makers' own licence terms, which their installers show. They stay installed if BeamLab is removed (remove them in Settings > Apps).\par
\par
BeamLab also contains the Basler pypylon and The Imaging Source imagingcontrol4 runtime libraries, Python, NumPy and Pillow, each under its own licence.\par
